    <p class="sub">Limited-time offers, on sale while inventory lasts.</p>
    <p>Coffee that is aging and is still well inside its freshness window, priced down honestly. You see the original price, the new price, and exactly how many days of freshness are left. No fake urgency, no countdown timers.</p>
