  <main class="ci-main">
    <ul class="promise-list">
      <li><div class="pn">1</div><div class="pt"><h3>Curated with love, never aggregated.</h3><p>A small group of Italian roasters - carefully chosen, not collected.</p></div></li>
      <li><div class="pn">2</div><div class="pt"><h3>Love your first bag, or we send a different one - free.</h3><p>Applies to Roccia, Sorpresa, and Selezione. Offerta is sold as-is.</p></div></li>
      <li><div class="pn">3</div><div class="pt"><h3>Cancel your subscription anytime in a couple of clicks.</h3><p>Pause, skip, swap, or cancel - all self-service, no minimum, no cancel fee.</p></div></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="prose" style="max-width:72ch">
      <h3>First-bag satisfaction guarantee</h3>
      <p>On Roccia, Sorpresa, and Selezione, if your first bag is not right for you, we will send a different one - free. We would rather help you find your coffee than win an argument.</p>
      <h3>Offerta is different - sold as-is</h3>
      <p>Offerta lots are good coffee approaching the edge of their freshness window, priced down honestly. They carry a narrower guarantee: we will replace a bag that is genuinely defective, but not one you simply wish were fresher. You will see the freshness window before you buy.</p>
      <h3>Damage replacement</h3>
      <p>If a bag arrives damaged, tell us and we will replace it.</p>
      <h3>Freshness window</h3>
      <p>We airfreight coffee freshly roasted in Italy in superior quality, sealed packages and ship them to you with ample time to enjoy. Every package has a roast date, and we recommend that you consume the coffee within {{ settings.freshness_window_days }} days of the roast date for maximum enjoyment.</p>
      <h3>Our no-waste pledge</h3>
      <p>Coffee that passes its freshness window is removed from sale and donated to Feeding Tampa Bay. We do not discount our way out of waste; we give it away.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>

